@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Product Consumption API Permissioning
	Testing Koroneiki Product Consumption API Permissioning functionality.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the permissions for a koroneiki product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" set for a non permissioned user
	* I tear down the permissions for the product consumption made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" for a non permissioned user
	* I tear down the product consumptions on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the following products
	| Liferay Digital Experience Platform |
	* I tear down the product consumptions on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Engineering" for the following products
	| Liferay Digital Experience Platform |
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following names
	| Koroneiki Automotive |
	* I tear down the products on koroneiki with the following names
	| Liferay Digital Experience Platform |

Scenario: Create product consumption attempt by non permissioned user
	Koroneiki product consumptions that are attempted to be created via API by non permissioned users should not be created.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	Given I create a product with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I attempt to create a product consumption for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values as a non permissioned user
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1 | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2 | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3 | propertyValue3 |
	Then I should not be able to view a product consumption on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"

Scenario: View product consumption attempt by non permissioned user
	Koroneiki product consumptions should not be viewable by non permissioned users.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	Given I create a product with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I create a product consumption for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1 | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2 | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3 | propertyValue3 |
	Then I should be able to view a product consumption on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" with the following values
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1 | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2 | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3 | propertyValue3 |
	And I should not be able to view a product consumption on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: Remove product consumption attempt by non permissioned user
	Koroneiki product consumptions should not be removable by non permissioned users.

