Scenario: Create product consumption external link attempt by non permissioned user
	Koroneiki product consumption external links should not be able to be created by non permissioned users.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	Given I create a product with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I create a product consumption for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1 | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2 | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3 | propertyValue3 |
	And I attempt to create an external link for a product consumption made by account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" with the following values as a non permissioned user
	| Domain      | liferaydxpconsumption |
	| Entity Id   | 1234                  |
	| Entity Name | LiferayDXPConsumption |
	Then the external link with the entity id "1234" should not be present on the product consumption made by account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"

Scenario: View product consumption external link attempt by non permissioned user
	Koroneiki product consumption external links should not be viewable via API by non permissioned users.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	Given I create a product with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I create a product consumption for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1 | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2 | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3 | propertyValue3 |
	And I create an external link for a product consumption made by account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" with the following values
	| Domain      | liferaydxpconsumption |
	| Entity Id   | 1234                  |
	| Entity Name | LiferayDXPConsumption |
	Then the external link with the entity id "1234" should be present on the product consumption made by account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" with the following values
	| Domain      | liferaydxpconsumption |
	| Entity Id   | 1234                  |
	| Entity Name | LiferayDXPConsumption |
	And the external link with the entity id "1234" on the product consumption made by account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" should not be visible to non permissioned users
	And I should not be able to view a product consumption on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" using the external link domain "liferaydxpconsumption" and entity name "LiferayDXPConsumption" and entity id "1234" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: Remove product consumption external link attempt by non permissioned user
	Koroneiki product consumption external links should not be removable via API by non permissioned users.

