	| Entity Name | LiferayDXPConsumption |
	And the external link with the entity id "1234" on the product consumption made by account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" should not be visible to non permissioned users
	And I should not be able to view a product consumption on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" using the external link domain "liferaydxpconsumption" and entity name "LiferayDXPConsumption" and entity id "1234" as a non permissioned user

